## TIẾNG ANH · 16:30–17:00

> *"I used Server-Sent Events instead of WebSockets because the app only needs server-to-client invalidation. When a meal changes, the API publishes an event and the phone invalidates TanStack Query. Two-way sockets would be extra moving parts for no gain yet."*

**5 từ:** `invalidate` · `one-way` · `moving parts` · `reconnect` · `fallback poll`

